OL,3,GNEWSADrakeford says Labour made
OL,4,Amistakes in failed mini-budget talks
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer First Minister Mark Drakeford
OL,7,Fsays his Labour party colleagues made
OL,8,Fmistakes in how they handled
OL,9,Fnegotiations over Plaid Cymru's summer
OL,10,Fmini-budget.
OL,12,FPlaid failed in the summer to get
OL,13,FLabour or any other opposition party to
OL,14,Fsupport changes to its spending plans.
OL,16,FDrakeford said his party "did well" to
OL,17,Fsecure more cash for children with
OL,18,Fadditional learning needs, and
OL,19,Fsuggested there was a case to be made
OL,20,Fto take the money.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
